 "corrected": true,
 "correction_note": "Pleyel's 'Douze quatuors ... oeuvre 39': twelve Boccherini quartets issued in four livraisons of three. RISM catalogues the whole publication as one record with one Gerard number. Berlin's copies all carry the same shelfmark DMS 51778 and are distinguished only by livraison, each scanned under its own SBB PPN. Munich holds all four livraisons (MDZ bsb11363152-55), which is the only complete set found; livraison 4 is held nowhere else in this collection. — Same instalment as Berlin's livraison 3, so its contents are almost certainly G 232, 213, 235 — worth a spot check against the Berlin scan before it is treated as settled.",
